 ## TL;DR
 
-**TON’s native token was officially renamed from Toncoin (TON) to Gram (GRAM) on June 15, 2026.** The community vote passed with 81.22% support. No swap or migration was required, and the chain remains The Open Network. “TON/GRAM” refers to the same asset here, called GRAM throughout. [Official rebrand announcement](https://t.me/s/gram/2388)
